Package: azr
Title: Credential Chain for OAuth 2.0 Authentication to 'Azure'
Version: 0.3.7.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Implements a credential chain for 'Azure' OAuth 2.0
    authentication, built on the OAuth framework of the 'httr2' package.
    Tries authentication methods in turn until one succeeds, so the same
    code runs on a laptop, in continuous integration and on an 'Azure'
    host. Supports client secret, workload identity, managed identity and
    'Azure CLI' credentials, plus interactive device code and authorization
    code flows during development.
